OL,3,GNEWSAMural artist aims to comfort
OL,4,Agrieving families
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn artist who has painted a mural in a
OL,7,Fhospital maternity unit's bereavement
OL,8,Froom said she "just wanted to bring
OL,9,Fsome comfort" to heartbroken families
OL,10,Fafter the loss of a baby.
OL,12,FAllie Pottinger created the mural at
OL,13,FMacclesfield General Hospital's
OL,14,FBluebell Suite, described as a private
OL,15,Fand peaceful space where families can
OL,16,Fbegin to grieve and spend time
OL,17,Ftogether.
OL,19,FShe said she chose the painting of
OL,20,Fbluebell woods for its calming
OL,21,Fproperties and solace featuring a gate
OL,22,Fshowing light "to offer some hope".
OL,23,APub: 02-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
