OL,3,GNEWSAMural artist aims to comfort
OL,4,Agrieving families
OL,5,
OL,6,FIt is the watercolour artist's fourth
OL,7,Fpainting in the hospital, which has a
OL,8,Fspecial place in her heart. Her late
OL,9,Ffather was a consultant surgeon for 22
OL,10,Fyears and her sister also now works
OL,11,Fthere.
